The LEDVANCE/Sylvania Tuya OEM app identity, cloud API signing and login flow,
schema-based mappings, and mix_rgbcw packet layout were ported from the user's
supplied hass-ledvance 0.2.0 integration (ledvance.zip).
Upstream: https://github.com/buggedcom/hass-ledvance
Copyright (c) 2024 buggedcom. MIT License; see LICENSE.

The upstream textbook RSA helper is dedicated to the public domain. This
package implements the same integer modular exponentiation with Node BigInt.

TuyAPI 7.7.1 supplies local Tuya communication and encryption. It is installed
as an npm dependency and retains its own MIT license.
https://github.com/codetheweb/tuyapi

Active GCM discovery uses the Tuya REQ_DEVINFO packet format also implemented
by tinytuya: https://github.com/jasonacox/tinytuya

Eve energy characteristic UUIDs follow the publicly used Eve HomeKit types.
No Eve history service or Apple Home energy dashboard is implemented.

